<div class="zone has-pivot" data-pivot="deployment-language-arm-template">
<h2 id="arm-template-resource-definition">ARM template resource definition</h2>
<p>The disks resource type can be deployed with operations that target:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Resource groups</strong> - See <a href="/en-us/azure/azure-resource-manager/templates/deploy-to-resource-group" data-linktype="absolute-path">resource group deployment commands</a>
For a list of changed properties in each API version, see <a href="change-log/disks" data-linktype="relative-path">change log</a>.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="usage-examples-1">Usage Examples</h2>
<h3 id="azure-quickstart-templates">Azure Quickstart Templates</h3>
<p>The following <a href="https://aka.ms/azqst" data-linktype="external">Azure Quickstart templates</a> deploy this resource type.</p>
