<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Name</th>
<th>Description</th>
<th>Value</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>diskEncryptionKey</td>
<td>Key Vault Secret Url and vault id of the disk encryption key</td>
<td><a href="#keyvaultandsecretreference-1" data-linktype="self-bookmark">KeyVaultAndSecretReference</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>keyEncryptionKey</td>
<td>Key Vault Key Url and vault id of the key encryption key. KeyEncryptionKey is optional and when provided is used to unwrap the disk encryption key.</td>
<td><a href="#keyvaultandkeyreference-1" data-linktype="self-bookmark">KeyVaultAndKeyReference</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
